++<li><code>AGENTS.md</code> — repo agent entry point</li>
++</ul>
++
++<h2>9. Rollout and documentation</h2>
++<ul>
++<li>Update public SDK docs when authoring flag contract is finalized.</li>
++<li>Sample app pattern: cache-first read, background update.</li>
